References: <CAPL76w8gK5hst6_MR_d1NCfy65FYfggzyG+dg6w_VVxuiu_OuA@mail.gmail.com>
 <CAGxgkWgkc3BHFdE6K0FsTys5Vv9BzNvHrx7EXcE=m1FQGwLG+w@mail.gmail.com>
Message-ID: <CAAMki4Fqiev9TeFNxL85+MvHD6p2krUakF7wCS6i_6enX-NcQg@mail.gmail.com>

You first need to type:
use_sp()

Then, read the raster from grass. For vector maps on the other hand, you
can either set:

use_sp()

or

use_sf()

before the import.

Best,
Vero



